===Etymology===
From {{etyl|xno|en}} {{m|fro|usser}}, from {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fro|ussier}}, {{m|fro|uissier||porter, doorman}} (compare French {{m|fr|huissier}}), from {{etyl|VL.|en}} *{{m|la||ustiārius|doorkeeper}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|ōstiārius}}, from {{m|la|ostium||door}}. Akin to {{m|la|ōs||mouth}}.

